{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion in a multimodal setup using the same encoders and configuration as the concat fusion experiment (llm_summary_001). Validation accuracy (0.523) is slightly lower than concat's 0.5266, with F1 also lower, suggesting weighted fusion may not outperform concat in this context. However, the small difference and lack of direct comparison to other fusion methods leave uncertainty about the criticality of fusion type in this setup."
}

